ntity: use9X Ø.19.\nHole location and spacing are unspecified.\nTwo R.25 notes repeat the same size.\nUse2X R.25 to identify both ends.\nThickness .10 is a source material note.","leader":null},{"id":"nvmg6fer","x":235.91147145266046,"y":123.89411245908349,"text":"QUALIFIED SPACING INTERPRETATION\nChosen equal spacing:8spaces at.50=4.00.\nThe source does not explicitly specify it.\nKeep the first-to-last center distance4.00.\nDo not add a redundant closed dimension chain.\nThis interpretation is not a publisher answer key.","leader":null},{"id":"n4ek8vla","x":35.74790500320958,"y":183.9431979428317,"text":"SOURCE / CORRECTION SCOPE\nThe drawn capsule and labels retain source layout.\nCircles mark missing quantity and duplicate radii.\nHole positions illustrate the chosen equal-spacing interpretation.\nNo new physical tolerance or material is invented.\nCorrected callouts are described in the answer notes.","leader":null}],"primitives":[{"id":"pslv0btn","type":"line","points":[{"x":54.76834109132035,"y":98.61856248990972},{"x":154.85014375218697,"y":98.61856248990972}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"pj3z8wgs","type":"line","points":[{"x":154.85014375218697,"y":111.1287902520357},{"x":54.76834109132035,"y":111.1287902520357}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"pzdco0pj","type":"line","points":[{"x":44.760186092217225,"y":104.8736958071139},{"x":164.85831818743128,"y":104.8736958071139}],"style":"center"},{"id":"p55cwasj","type":"arc","points":[{"x":154.85014375218697,"y":98.61856248990972},{"x":161.10525763324995,"y":104.8736958071139},{"x":154.85014375218697,"y":111.1287902520357}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"p1ahrans","type":"arc","points":[{"x":54.76834109132035,"y":111.1287902520357},{"x":48.51322721025736,"y":104.8736958071139},{"x":54.76834109132035,"y":98.61856248990972}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"po8rrqdo","type":"circle","points":[{"x":54.76834109132035,"y":104.8736958071139},{"x":57.14528397740146,"y":104.8736958071139}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"pbcpxdil","type":"circle","